  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::dialogueTrigger
  lines:
  - i hope that inversion of control is'nt too frequent,what now?
  - there is a barallel, shoot it to make it explode to damage everything around,including
    you
  - FINALLY! something that is normal!
  - actually...the barallels have a small chance of healing the enemies instead on
    damaging them
  - ofc it does.....gosh man i can't wait to get out of this.
  speakers:
  - YOU
  - Anthony
  - YOU
  - Anthony
  - YOU
  d: {fileID: 759297511}
